# Creator files - kept on this machine, kept OFF the site.
#
# This repo IS the published site: everything committed here is served at
# narbehouse.github.io. None of the files below is needed to play the game, so
# none of them belongs on a public page. They still live in this folder - they
# are ignored, not deleted - so the harness and the editor work exactly as
# before locally.
#
# What the game actually loads is index.html, js/, images/, audio/vo/*.mp3,
# audio/vo/index.json and ../../../shared/*. That is the whole runtime.

# The test harness and the picture-taking scripts (~50 files).
tools/

# The lake/quest editor. Not linked from anywhere in the game - unlike
# BENNYSPEGGLE's editor.html, which its game opens in a window and which
# therefore has to stay published.
editor.html

# The authoring source for the content bundle. Safe to keep out of the repo:
# `python tools/build_content.py` writes js/content.generated.js from these,
# and that bundle carries the same data byte for byte - the _README authoring
# notes included - so content/ can be rebuilt from what ships if it is ever
# lost. Edit these, run the build, commit the bundle.
content/

# Instructions for whoever is recording Walt's lines. audio/vo/index.json is
# NOT here: the game fetches it at runtime to find the clips.
audio/vo/TO_RECORD.md
audio/vo/DESKTOP_PROMPT.txt

# Screenshots the browser tools drop in this folder as they run.
desktop_*.png
phone-land_*.png
phone-port_*.png
small-land_*.png
small-port_*.png

# Scratch probes written at the game root while debugging. They are throwaway
# and this folder is served to the public, so they must never be committed -
# one slipped through on 2026-09-12 and had to be pulled back out.
/*.js
!/index.html
